{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":1,"exerciseID":"615f961953170f0f07243d20","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":8,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"八年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)(0,2) (2)4 (3)(-1,1)或 (-3,-1)","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5eccb411518ec3c65e1e916c","queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d20","schCode":"3013","textbookId":"5ecc92f2518ec3c65e1e9137"}],"question":"在平面直角坐标系中，有 A(-2,a+1) ， B(a-1,4) ，C(b-2,b) 三点． (1)当点C 在 y 轴上时，求点C 的坐标； (2)当 AB∥x 轴时，求A， B两点间的距离； (3)当CD⊥x 轴于点 D，且CD=1时，求点C的坐标．","solution":"(1)∵点C 在 y 轴上， ∴b-2=0 ，解得b=2 ， ∴C 点坐标为 (0,2) ； (2)∵AB∥x 轴， ∴A、 B 点的纵坐标相同， ​​​​​​​∴a+1=4 ，解得 a=3 ， ​​​​​​​∴A(-2,4) ， B(2,4) ， ​​​​​​​∴A， B 两点间的距离-2 -(-2)=4 ； (3)∵CD⊥x 轴， CD=1， ​​​​​​​∴|b|=1，解得b=±1， ​​​​​​​∴C 点坐标为(-1,1)或 (-3,-1).","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec4dbe7518ec3c65e1e8c62","knowName":"坐标轴上点的坐标特征","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d20","sortIndex":1141},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec4dbfd2abd365ea81e8709","knowName":"与坐标轴平行的直线上点的坐标特征","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d20","sortIndex":1143},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ec4dc22518ec3c65e1e8c68","knowName":"坐标平面中点的位置确定","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d20","sortIndex":1147},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ec4dc3b518ec3c65e1e8c6c","knowName":"坐标平面中的距离问题","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d20","sortIndex":1149}]}